    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6a78841e0ad243790e9bc852ad589c3a.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6a78841e0ad243790e9bc852ad589c3a.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6a78841e0ad243790e9bc852ad589c3a.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An English translated demo version is in the works! Please add our game to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/24e608aeafe761185d5ac6656c0ca11d.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/24e608aeafe761185d5ac6656c0ca11d.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/24e608aeafe761185d5ac6656c0ca11d.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>\u300eThere is NO PLAN B\u300f</strong> is a <strong>\u300cNarrative Adventure Game\u300d</strong> featuring Anime Style characters with world-class Spine2D animation, coupled with realistic 3D background graphics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/1039946affb95f9e64248b03d8bca34c.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/1039946affb95f9e64248b03d8bca34c.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/1039946affb95f9e64248b03d8bca34c.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the year 2070, step into the role of \u300cB\u300d, a Hikikomori private eye in \u300cSoul City\u300d\u2014a metropolis dominated by the mega-corp \u300cTrinity Inc\u300d. Investigate and solve a variety of cases that emerge in this cyberpunk world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/407e8413c6cde9ec7ed0108f789c843e.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/407e8413c6cde9ec7ed0108f789c843e.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/407e8413c6cde9ec7ed0108f789c843e.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Due to an <strong>unfortunate incident</strong>, B became a subcontractor for SCPD(Soul City Police Department) and had to investigate various cases assigned by them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/af64d44bac2338e2016ecec8ae444662.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/af64d44bac2338e2016ecec8ae444662.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/af64d44bac2338e2016ecec8ae444662.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your investigation won't be a solo endeavor \u2013 a variety of captivating partners will lend their expertise to help you analyzing the proof you've uncovered.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d6a391e84a3b636de52a45372a30f772.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d6a391e84a3b636de52a45372a30f772.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d6a391e84a3b636de52a45372a30f772.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d21c54278d863a6f6bc52c74ae0037.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d21c54278d863a6f6bc52c74ae0037.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d21c54278d863a6f6bc52c74ae0037.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Harness advanced cyberpunk tech to investigate crime scenes, gather the clues left behind by the criminals, and piece together the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/4f597066065c114041590d151dccc999.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/4f597066065c114041590d151dccc999.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/4f597066065c114041590d151dccc999.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A <strong>unique arrest system</strong> awaits you, allowing you to arrest the criminals you've uncovered through your investigation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d3a208126203258b7b6ce4c8b02ec7.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d3a208126203258b7b6ce4c8b02ec7.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d3a208126203258b7b6ce4c8b02ec7.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And, of course, don't forget to invite the colorful cast of characters to <strong>dinner parties</strong>, where you can spend quality time over a delightful meal!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/3287c20ff4cf3058872f7a990d487101.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/3287c20ff4cf3058872f7a990d487101.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6a78841e0ad243790e9bc852ad589c3a.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6a78841e0ad243790e9bc852ad589c3a.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/6a78841e0ad243790e9bc852ad589c3a.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An English translated demo version is in the works! Please add our game to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/24e608aeafe761185d5ac6656c0ca11d.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/24e608aeafe761185d5ac6656c0ca11d.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/24e608aeafe761185d5ac6656c0ca11d.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>\u300eThere is NO PLAN B\u300f</strong> is a <strong>\u300cNarrative Adventure Game\u300d</strong> featuring Anime Style characters with world-class Spine2D animation, coupled with realistic 3D background graphics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/1039946affb95f9e64248b03d8bca34c.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/1039946affb95f9e64248b03d8bca34c.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/1039946affb95f9e64248b03d8bca34c.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the year 2070, step into the role of \u300cB\u300d, a Hikikomori private eye in \u300cSoul City\u300d\u2014a metropolis dominated by the mega-corp \u300cTrinity Inc\u300d. Investigate and solve a variety of cases that emerge in this cyberpunk world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/407e8413c6cde9ec7ed0108f789c843e.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/407e8413c6cde9ec7ed0108f789c843e.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/407e8413c6cde9ec7ed0108f789c843e.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Due to an <strong>unfortunate incident</strong>, B became a subcontractor for SCPD(Soul City Police Department) and had to investigate various cases assigned by them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/af64d44bac2338e2016ecec8ae444662.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/af64d44bac2338e2016ecec8ae444662.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/af64d44bac2338e2016ecec8ae444662.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your investigation won't be a solo endeavor \u2013 a variety of captivating partners will lend their expertise to help you analyzing the proof you've uncovered.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d6a391e84a3b636de52a45372a30f772.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d6a391e84a3b636de52a45372a30f772.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/d6a391e84a3b636de52a45372a30f772.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d21c54278d863a6f6bc52c74ae0037.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d21c54278d863a6f6bc52c74ae0037.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d21c54278d863a6f6bc52c74ae0037.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Harness advanced cyberpunk tech to investigate crime scenes, gather the clues left behind by the criminals, and piece together the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/4f597066065c114041590d151dccc999.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/4f597066065c114041590d151dccc999.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/4f597066065c114041590d151dccc999.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A <strong>unique arrest system</strong> awaits you, allowing you to arrest the criminals you've uncovered through your investigation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d3a208126203258b7b6ce4c8b02ec7.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d3a208126203258b7b6ce4c8b02ec7.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/e8d3a208126203258b7b6ce4c8b02ec7.mp4?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And, of course, don't forget to invite the colorful cast of characters to <strong>dinner parties</strong>, where you can spend quality time over a delightful meal!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/3287c20ff4cf3058872f7a990d487101.poster.avif?t=1753671106\" width=620 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928190/extras/3287c20ff4cf3058872f7a990d487101.webm?t=1753671106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
